@host = http://localhost:3001
@baseUrl = {{host}}/memories

### 1. REGISTER akun baru (password akan di-hash dengan bcrypt)
POST {{host}}/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kaisar",
  "email": "kaisar@aira.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. LOGIN untuk mendapatkan JWT accessToken (rate limit: 5 req/menit)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kaisar@aira.local",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Simpan token otomatis dari response login di atas
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. UJI 401: Akses endpoint privat TANPA token (wajib ditolak 401)
GET {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1

### 4. UJI 401: Akses endpoint privat dengan token TIDAK VALID
GET {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer token-tidak-valid

### 5. GET profil user aktif (dengan Bearer token)
GET {{host}}/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. GET semua memori (endpoint privat dengan Bearer token)
GET {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. POST tambah memori baru (dengan Bearer token)
POST {{baseUrl}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "category": "study",
  "factText": "Pengguna telah mengimplementasikan JWT Auth dan keamanan dasar di AIRA.",
  "importance": 5,
  "isActive": true
}

### 8. PATCH ubah memori (dengan Bearer token)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/MEM-01 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "importance": 5,
  "factText": "Nama panggilan pengguna adalah Kaisar."
}

### 9. GET statistik & filter lanjutan (dengan Bearer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. DELETE memori berdasarkan ID (dengan Bearer token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/MEM-03 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. UJI RATE LIMITING (429): Klik Send 6 kali beruntun dalam 1 menit
POST {{host}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kaisar@aira.local",
  "password": "password-salah"
}
